    1. Pick grid H in [11,15], W in [7,9]
    2. Pick bar_col in [2, W-2] ensuring cols_right >= 2
    3. Pick bar_height in [3, min(H-1, 7)] ensuring bar_height - 2 > 0 (at least 1 pink col visible)
    4. Place grey bar at column bar_col, rows 0..bar_height-1 on black grid
